      "created_at": "2015-05-22T15:53:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hard to say. My initial assumption is that all movement decreasing effects would be consistent so it could be an oversight. However, Citizens having strong unique effects is not out of the ordinary either.&nbsp;</p><p>Remember that OmnitronV still has his Rocket Jump, and if the Dawn player is using Winter instead of some of the other crazy strong Citizens, I'd take that every day of the week and twice on Sundays.</p>",
