      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ecb155/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-26T16:01:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looks like it's just an oversight in the reminder text. The other effects that reduce move value both say \"Move value cannot be reduced below 1.\" If they said \"This power cannot reduce move value below 1,\" then I would say Winter could actually stop someone dead in their tracks. Also, having a move value of 0 is inconsistent with the way the value is tracked, since you can't turn your d6 to a face that shows a 0.</p>",
