      "created_at": "2015-05-29T13:43:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Citizen Winter can, in fact, reduce her target's Movement Value to 0! That said, her attack isn't unlimited, so she can only do it once per turn. And, as Foote pointed out, that does not prevent Rocket Jumping (if you're Omnitron) or Sprinting (if you're a character who can Sprint).</p>",
